---
// /community/: which kind of report or post goes where on GitHub.
---

<figure class="diagram" style="margin:0">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 760 384" role="img" aria-labelledby="cw-t cw-d">
		<title id="cw-t">Where to post</title>
		<desc id="cw-d">Questions go to Discussions Q&amp;A, bugs to an issue with the bug report form, ideas to Discussions Ideas and then a feature request, how-tos to Discussions How-tos and cheat sheets, and vulnerabilities to a private security report.</desc>
		<g>
			<rect class="d-box" x="20" y="20" width="280" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="38" y="44">I have a question</text><text class="d-s" x="38" y="63">install, config, how do I…</text>
			<rect class="d-acc" x="440" y="20" width="300" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="458" y="44">Discussions · Q&amp;A</text><text class="d-s" x="458" y="63">answered by the community</text>
			<path class="d-arrow acc" d="M300 48 H436" marker-end="url(#aha)"/>
		</g>
		<g>
			<rect class="d-box" x="20" y="92" width="280" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="38" y="116">Something is broken</text><text class="d-s" x="38" y="135">an error, a crash, wrong data</text>
			<rect class="d-acc" x="440" y="92" width="300" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="458" y="116">Issues · Bug report</text><text class="d-s" x="458" y="135">version, deployment, logs</text>
			<path class="d-arrow acc" d="M300 120 H436" marker-end="url(#aha)"/>
		</g>
		<g>
			<rect class="d-box" x="20" y="164" width="280" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="38" y="188">I have an idea</text><text class="d-s" x="38" y="207">something Obzly should do</text>
			<rect class="d-acc" x="440" y="164" width="300" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="458" y="188">Discussions · Ideas</text><text class="d-s" x="458" y="207">then a feature request</text>
			<path class="d-arrow acc" d="M300 192 H436" marker-end="url(#aha)"/>
		</g>
		<g>
			<rect class="d-box" x="20" y="236" width="280" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="38" y="260">I wrote a how-to</text><text class="d-s" x="38" y="279">a query, config or recipe</text>
			<rect class="d-acc" x="440" y="236" width="300" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="458" y="260">Discussions · How-tos</text><text class="d-s" x="458" y="279">and cheat sheets</text>
			<path class="d-arrow acc" d="M300 264 H436" marker-end="url(#aha)"/>
		</g>
		<g>
			<rect class="d-box" x="20" y="308" width="280" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="38" y="332">I found a vulnerability</text><text class="d-s" x="38" y="351">never post it publicly</text>
			<rect class="d-amb" x="440" y="308" width="300" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="d-t" x="458" y="332">Private security report</text><text class="d-s" x="458" y="351">Security tab · SECURITY.md</text>
			<path class="d-dash" d="M300 336 H436" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
		</g>
	</svg>
	</figure>
